Z||000000||fiero32||05-17-2001||06:38 PM||||Dose anyone know a web site where i could buy a IMSA wide body kit for my 87 fiero. If not an IMSA then any wide body kit is good <P> thanks FIERO32||||reg||10
Z||000001||Oreif||05-17-2001||06:44 PM||||IRM sells the IMSA/SD4 body kit but no website. They sell both the notchback and fastback kits. <P>The IMSA and SD4 kits are the same kits just named differently. Originally they were called the SD4 kits but when the IMSA race cars used the same body folks started calling them the IMSA kit.<P>This place sells the notchback kit. <A HREF="http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com/fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com/fiero.html</A>  <P>The kits run about $3500.00 at both places.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">     <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 05-17-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||AusFiero||05-17-2001||07:58 PM||||Wow that much for a kit.<BR>God you guys are going to get a very pleasant suprise when my stage 2 body kit gets released  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero.gif"> <BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||05-17-2001||08:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B>Wow that much for a kit.<BR>God you guys are going to get a very pleasant suprise when my stage 2 body kit gets released   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You have to remember, that the kits are the entire body not add-on style parts. The only Items not in the kit is the hood, roof, and decklid. Everything else is in the kit.<BR>||||reg||1
